======================================================================================================================
VERDICT
======================================================================================================================
  9 non-identity cells on the full held-out block. The copula
  describes the joint law better than independence, by a paired interval
  excluding zero, in 9 of 9; worse in 0.
  HO1: better 9, worse 0, of 9.
  HO2: better 9, worse 0, of 9.

  THIS DOES NOT TOUCH THE CALIBRATION SCOREBOARD. The marginals are
  QTREE's, unchanged. The copula only says how the two marginals
  combine on the same path -- the input a joint stop-and-target rule
  needs. Whether to set them jointly is a strategy-phase decision.

